# Wall Crawl {3}{G}: "Spiders you control ... can't be blocked by creatures with defender." Bot1's Spider token (3/2 with reach) and Llanowar Elves attack Bot2, who has a
# Wall of Stone (0/8, defender) and a Grizzly Bears (no defender). The Wall may not block the Spider but may block the Elves, which are no Spider; the Bears may block the Spider.
# The Wall blocks the Elves and the Bears the Spider: the Spider (3/2) takes 2 and dies, the Bears take 3 and die.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Llanowar Elves
Wall Crawl
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Wall of Stone
Grizzly Bears
Island x15

